        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Deep red ground with pattern of large-scale ogive enclosing a central stylized rosette. Pattern produced by extra wefts of silver thread (flat metal strips) shot through the surface–when not needed for design pass to reverse of fabric--results in a damask-like effect."@en ;
